# The underglow's levels by power state: 80% on battery (also before any event), 100% on USB, 12%
# below 20% charge, leaving the low level only at 22% (hysteresis), off = 100% everywhere, a bad
# config refused, the app's own levels; integer division, a lit channel stays >= 1, and the
# caller's buffer is never written.
/^dim: /p
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
